    "faq": {
      "type": "faq",
      "blocks": {
        "q1": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is a lab-grown diamond?",
            "answer": "A lab grown diamond is a diamond that is produced in a controlled laboratory environment and advanced technological processes that replicate the natural conditions under which diamonds form in the Earth's mantle. Lab grown diamonds are chemically, physically, and optically identical to natural diamonds. They have reduced environmental and ethical concerns associated with diamond mining."
          }
        },
        "q2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How can you tell the difference between a lab-grown and natural diamond?",
            "answer": "Lab-grown and natural diamonds can look identical to the naked eye and cannot be reliably distinguished with standard testing tools. Trained jewellers and experts can’t also tell the difference between them. They can only be distinguished from natural diamonds using specialized equipment that can detect the specific growth patterns and inclusions characteristic of their synthetic origin."
          }
        },
        "q3": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Are Zinara's lab-grown diamonds certified?",
            "answer": "Yes, lab grown diamonds are graded and certified by the same gemological laboratories that evaluate natural diamonds. Renowned organizations like GIA, IGI, and SGL provide these certifications. The grading process for lab grown diamonds is identical to that for natural diamonds, ensuring transparency and quality assurance. All lab grown diamonds used in jewellery offered by ZINARA are graded and certified by these laboratory organizations."
          }
        },
        "q4": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is gold vermeil?",
            "answer": "Gold vermeil is 925 sterling silver finished with a layer of gold. Zinara jewellery features 18K gold vermeil with 6 layers of gold plating, making it 5× thicker than standard plating.\nOur pieces are designed to be waterproof, sweatproof and durable for everyday wear. And when your jewellery eventually needs a refresh, we also offer replating services to restore its finish."
          }
        },
        "q5": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How long does delivery take?",
