            "answer": "At Zinara, your satisfaction is our highest priority. We strive to ensure every purchase brings you joy and confidence. If your experience falls short, you can return your purchase within 7 days of delivery, no questions asked. We offer a transparent and hassle-free return and refund process, subject to our Return & Refund Policy."
