          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I care for my Zinara jewellery?",
            "answer": "Zinara jewellery is waterproof, sweatproof and made for everyday wear. That said, a little care can help keep your pieces looking their best for longer.\nAvoid prolonged exposure to perfumes, harsh chemicals, chlorine and abrasive products, and wipe your jewellery gently with a soft, dry cloth after wearing. When you're not wearing it, store it in a clean, dry place away from other jewellery."
