            "question": "Why vermeil instead of solid gold?",
            "answer": "Gold vermeil gives you the look and long-lasting shine of solid gold jewelry at an accessible luxury price point. Crafted with a thick coating of 18k real gold (at least 2.5 microns) over a 925 sterling silver base, it offers superior durability over standard gold-plated pieces."
          }
        },
